      "id": "claim_d0a57c14eb59439db236c29e90d24d57",
      "statement": "The SRE source note treats reliability as a target rather than an absolute maximum: teams measure user experience with an SLI, set an SLO, and use the allowed shortfall as an error budget that permits change while available and shifts emphasis toward stability when spent; the target and consequences must be explicit for the service.",
