      "statement": "Toil automation should detect and cluster recurring production failures, correlate them with source and deploys, act through a human review gate, use quality evaluations alongside error signals for AI-backed services, and track recurrence so failures become regression examples; noisy or speculative output can recreate toil as review work.",
